+
+Issue: https://github.com/w3c/pointerevents/issues/656
+
+This test is tentative because I'm not sure whether it's the correct behavior.
+It's possible that cross-document should be treated the same as cross-origin.
+
+pointerevent_boundary_events_cross_origin.html tests that the cross-origin
+cases do not expose the true relatedTarget node (which is required for
